<title>USA: Compaq, other computer companies continue rise.</title>
<headline>Compaq, other computer companies continue rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Compaq Computer Corp and other computer companies continued to rise Tuesday, bolstered by bullish comments by Merrill Lynch and a strong outlook for the quarter, analysts said.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch analyst Lucianne Painter said she raised her target price on Compaq Computer Corp to $125 from $105. Painter said she reiterated her intermediate and long-term buy recommendation on Compaq.</p>
<p>Merrill hosted a dinner Monday evening for Compaq, Painter said.</p>
